"Daren!"

Silence.

"Hey, Daren!"

Daren jerks upright, blinking hard as he scrambles for his sword.

"What happened? Where's the stillwater?"

"That's the second time you've asked me those exact words. He's gone. Vanished the second he put you under."

"Put me under? No—that's impossible. I have layered sleep wards woven into this armor. I should be nearly immune, or at the very least conscious enough to resist!"

"I'm telling you what I saw. I don't have an explanation either."

"Wait a moment. Didn't we just see him fling fire magic too? Something is fundamentally wrong here. He hit me with compressed air yesterday. How does anyone command two separate elements? Mastering even one takes half a lifetime!"

}
choice(""Maybe he has some artifact that's helping him?"", Ch5-Artifact, v_current_scene = Ch5-Artifact, v_checkpoint_rich = 0) if (v_ch4_ending == 1 || v_ch4_ending == 4 || v_ch4_ending == 6)
choice(""Maybe he's older than he looks?"", Ch5-Older, v_current_scene = Ch5-Older, v_checkpoint_rich = 0) if (v_ch4_ending == 1 || v_ch4_ending == 4 || v_ch4_ending == 6)
choice(""Maybe he made a pact with some god?"", Ch5-Pact, v_current_scene = Ch5-Pact, v_checkpoint_rich = 0) if (v_ch4_ending == 1 || v_ch4_ending == 4 || v_ch4_ending == 6)
choice(""It sounds like a threat."", Ch5-Threat, v_current_scene = Ch5-Threat) if (v_ch4_ending == 2)
choice(""It sounds like a coded message."", Ch5-Coded, v_current_scene = Ch5-Coded) if (v_ch4_ending == 2)
choice("Continue", Ch5-Wake-Kate, v_current_scene = Ch5-Wake-Kate, v_checkpoint_rich = 0) if (v_ch4_ending == 3 || v_ch4_ending == 5)


ID: Ch5-Artifact
TEXT:

"Maybe he has some artifact that's helping him?"

"No," Daren shakes his head. "If he carried an offensive relic of that caliber, we would have seen it drawn or felt the aura radiating off it at close quarters. Most high-tier combat artifacts take the form of weapons, and his hands were empty."

"Regardless, we need to wake Kate. She needs to hear this, and we're long overdue for a strategy meeting."

The two of us head for our cave and proceed to wake Kate from her slumber.

choice("Continue", Ch5-Wake-Kate, v_current_scene = Ch5-Wake-Kate)


ID: Ch5-Older
TEXT:

"Maybe he's older than he looks?"

Daren furrows his brow, turning the idea over.

"You might have a point, Barry," he says. "When I swung at him, he anticipated every line of attack without even tapping his aura to evade. Most veteran duelists would struggle to dodge my opening cut. But how would we verify his real age?"

"We could just ask him."

"Ask him? Have you lost your mind?"

"Why not? He doesn't strike me as someone who bothers hiding his history. And he transitions from attempted murder to casual conversation without missing a beat."

Daren rubs his temples. "Sometimes I wonder about you, Barry."

"Regardless, we need to wake Kate. She needs to hear this, and we're long overdue for a strategy meeting."

The two of us head for our cave and proceed to wake Kate from her slumber.

choice("Continue", Ch5-Wake-Kate, v_current_scene = Ch5-Wake-Kate)


ID: Ch5-Pact
TEXT:

"Maybe he made a pact with some god?"

"Leave fairy tales in storybooks, Barry. I have never encountered a genuine covenant between a mortal and a deity, and I find it impossible to believe any god would grant that arrogant brat the time of day."

"Regardless, we need to wake Kate. She needs to hear this, and we're long overdue for a strategy meeting."

choice("Continue", Ch5-Wake-Kate, v_current_scene = Ch5-Wake-Kate)


ID: Ch5-Wake-Kate
TEXT:

#if(v_ch3_bloodied == 0 && v_ch3_kate_badly_hurt == 0) {
